OL,3,GNEWSA'I created art to get fly-tip of
OL,4,Aurine bottles cleared'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman created artwork out of
OL,7,F"desperation" to draw attention to a
OL,8,Flarge fly-tip near her home that
OL,9,Fincluded "empty bottles filled to the
OL,10,Fbrim with urine".
OL,12,FMary Courtney said rubbish had been
OL,13,Fpiling up in the alleyway linking
OL,14,FBroomfield Road and Kensington Road in
OL,15,FCoventry, despite repeated reports to
OL,16,Fthe council and raising concerns with
OL,17,Flocal representatives.
OL,19,FFrustrated by the lack of action, she
OL,20,Finstalled a temporary art display among
OL,21,Fthe waste to highlight the issue. The
OL,22,Frubbish was cleared shortly afterwards.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
